Subject: [PATCH] release: v0.1.3.2 README, CHANGELOG, run docs and the
 ship-gate receipts

README.md is the v0.1.3.2 page: the S-X8 rows come from the v0.1.3.2 ship gate (DFlash2 depth 6, 10.86 / 9.79 t/s, +13.78% pooled against v0.1.3.1), a v0.1.3.2 What-is-new block and History row. CHANGELOG.md gains the v0.1.3.2 section above v0.1.3.1, its commit ids re-keyed to this repository. docs/arifi/ENVIRONMENT.md documents the four variables new in this release and every source citation is regenerated against this tree; HOW-WE-RUN.md takes the S-X8 numbers; STATUS.md points to the new receipts. evidence/v0.1.3.2/ carries the ship-gate receipts with sha256 in its MANIFEST.md. The published v0.1.3.1 documents (NOTICE, licences, run docs, BUILDING, OPTIONS-REGISTRY, sidecar README, earlier receipts) are carried from b11178-v0.1.3.1; the banner shows v0.1.3.2.

Origin: ArifiLabs (native) - release documentation for this fork; no upstream origin exists.
Measured-effect: UNMEASURED - documents and receipts only; no code path is touched.
