+## v0.1.3.2 - 2026-10-10 (branch `b11178-v0.1.3.2`, tag `v0.1.3.2`, upstream `b11178`, evidence `evidence/v0.1.3.2/`)
+
+A fix-and-speed release on v0.1.3.1, measured on the Radeon 890M (Minisforum AI X1 Pro-470). Ship gate vs v0.1.3.1 on
+llama-server, every served mode, short (12-token) and long (597-token) prompts, greedy output ids identical on every
+request of all four models (GLM-5.3 Flash DFlash2 is measured separately and is not part of this gate):
+
+| Model | Modes | Decode (pooled) | Prompt (pooled) | Receipt |
+|---|---|---|---|---|
+| Qwen3.8-Flash-Next IQ3_S | plain, MTP, MTP + 40K draft vocabulary | +0.59% | +0.24% | `rg-fn-10101652`, `rg-fn-10101930` |
+| Ornith-1.5 35B-A3B | plain, MTP, DFlash2 | +0.02% | +0.19% | `rg-orn-10101818`, `rg-orn-10101952` |
+| Qwen3.8 27B UD-Q4_K_XL | plain, MTP, DFlash2 depth 6 | +0.42% | +0.18% | `rg-q27-10102055` |
+| S-X8 v4.3 27B | plain, DFlash2 depth 6 | +3.06% | +0.86% | `rg-sx8-10102114` |
+
+Bar: whole-model pooled tokens / time, floor max(1%, A-to-A spread); reads `rg132p-pooled.txt`, `rg132w-q27sx8-pooled.txt`.
+
+### Fixed
+- MTP drafting could read stale K on the MTP layer after a freed KV cell was zeroed: the zero fill raced the graph on
+  the transfer queue (2 of 46 probes stale on v0.1.3.1). Fills now run on the compute queue behind the graph, batched
+  into one submit per apply; the host path drains the queue first. Commits `fe705dd8ce` `80fbe0e7bb` `4a80908caf`
+  `0fed9df19f`; receipts `kvzp-10091505` (FAIL on v0.1.3.1), `kvzo-10100057-verdict.txt` (PASS, ids == v0.1.3.1).
+
+### Added
+- Qwen3.8-Flash-Next GGUFs in the upstream #29761 MTP layout (full and MTP-only files) load and draft; their logits
